{"id":"669341484","kind":"article","title":"3B4：活动指南","author":"Refold","original_authors":["Refold"],"original_source_urls":["https://refold.la/roadmap/stage-3/b/activity-guide"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"外语习得","date":"2023-11-29","updated":"2023-12-12","votes":21,"comment_count":0,"minutes":2,"chars":836,"keywords":["二语习得","写作练习","影子跟读","语言交换","沉浸式学习","Refold"],"summary":"本篇为 Refold 3B 阶段的活动指南，建议通过实时写作或语言交换激活已有语言知识，用影子跟读训练发音，并继续沉浸于语言家长和访谈类材料。文中给出每日时间安排，建议隔天轮换输出活动；当学习者能理解语言家长并流畅书写后，可进入口语阶段。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/669341484","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"语言激活"},{"id":"sec-2","level":3,"title":"应用"},{"id":"sec-3","level":3,"title":"网站"},{"id":"sec-4","level":2,"title":"锻炼发音肌肉"},{"id":"sec-5","level":2,"title":"理解对话"},{"id":"sec-6","level":2,"title":"日程示例"},{"id":"sec-7","level":2,"title":"进阶"}],"html":"<blockquote data-pid=\"JXaypdei\">返回目录：<a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"671671625\" href=\"#/post/671671625\">从 0 开始学外语：Refold 路线图（详细版）</a></blockquote><p data-pid=\"s6fCBpbQ\">在阶段 3B，我们专注于三个独立的领域，为你的口语表达做好准备：</p><ol><li data-pid=\"xcH1QnI9\"> 通过写作激活已习得的语言。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"hCroRnZ4\"> 建立正确发音的肌肉记忆。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"bgrMaTU7\"> 精通日常对话的理解。<br/> </li></ol><h2 id=\"sec-1\">语言激活</h2><p data-pid=\"r9fPI1FJ\">如 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://refold.la/roadmap/stage-3/b/language-activation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">3B：语言激活</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>中所述，你将通过挖掘你潜在的语言能力来磨练你的写作能力。</p><p data-pid=\"lZxffs4D\">我们建议你进行实时书面交流。下面是一些你可以找到语言交换伙伴的地方：</p><h3 id=\"sec-2\">应用</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"f3GQPiK9\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.tandem.net/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Tandem</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"9uuF_GOi\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://brc.hellotalk.com/refold\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">HelloTalk</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"6BFJoCnQ\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://bilingua.io/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bilingua</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"yXY2H3gI\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/languagelearning/comments/5m5426/discord_language_learning_servers_masterlist/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Discord 语言服务器</a><br/> </li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-3\">网站</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"OlaFDsLD\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.conversationexchange.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Conversation Exchange</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"vayfrA1e\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.mylanguageexchange.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">My Language Exchange</a><br/> </li></ul><p data-pid=\"mc5Z5KX_\">如果想到与陌生人交流让你感到不安，你也可以选择聘请一名私教，通过聊天进行交流。比较知名的聘请私教的网站包括 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://go.italki.com/refold\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">iTalki</a> 和 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.verbling.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Verbling</a>。</p><p data-pid=\"XlK-3YcZ\">如果你选择独自写作而非对话，可以使用 iTalki 上的「笔记本」功能，寻找愿意批改长篇写作的人。</p><h2 id=\"sec-4\">锻炼发音肌肉</h2><p data-pid=\"wvX_gunk\">每天花时间进行影子跟读，并练习你所学语言的绕口令，具体可参考 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://refold.la/roadmap/stage-3/b/pronunciation-training\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">3B：发音训练</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>。</p><h2 id=\"sec-5\">理解对话</h2><p data-pid=\"bs_nNpWC\">这部分内容与 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://refold.la/roadmap/stage-3/a/activity-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">3A：活动指南</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>无异。继续沉浸在你的语言家长、文字聊天以及脱口秀节目中。</p><h2 id=\"sec-6\">日程示例</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"iB_zu7Tn\"> 早上用 Anki<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"RvvjplHX\"> 整天被动收听你的语言家长<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"9CmW1yoE\"> 花 30 分钟练习输出（写作或影子跟读）<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"k9XLMYio\"> 花 45 分钟沉浸学习语言家长的材料<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"TBySaiy-\"> 花 45 分钟阅读或听脱口秀节目<br/> </li></ul><p data-pid=\"8_puKbiS\">我们建议以天为单位交替进行输出活动，比如第一天专注写作，第二天影子跟读。</p><h2 id=\"sec-7\">进阶 </h2><p data-pid=\"GuwmMwy5\">当你对语言家长的理解达到<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://refold.la/roadmap/stage-2/a/levels-of-comprehension#Level-6-Automatic\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">等级 6</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>，并且能够在写作中流畅表达自己时，就可以进入阶段 3C：口语表达。</p><p data-pid=\"L3Ct8DHi\">有些人可能不太喜欢写作，更愿意直接开口说。如果你属于这类，那么可以同时进行阶段 3B 和 3C。</p><hr/><p data-pid=\"XuKg06My\">上一篇：<a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"668913799\" href=\"#/post/668913799\">3B3：发音训练</a></p><p data-pid=\"HS4sZbx9\">下一篇：<a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"669543698\" href=\"#/post/669543698\">3C1：能力与表现</a></p><hr/><blockquote data-pid=\"Yhr41D3u\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 GPT-4，校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://refold.la/roadmap/stage-3/b/activity-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Activity Guide | Refold</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 3B1：语言激活 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"668072036\" href=\"#/post/668072036\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 3B3：发音训练 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"668913799\" href=\"#/post/668913799\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 3A2：活动指南 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"667062859\" href=\"#/post/667062859\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 2A4：理解等级 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"660585871\" href=\"#/post/660585871\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"668913799","title":"3B3：发音训练","author":"Refold","votes":28,"minutes":7,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 外语习得"},{"id":"669543698","title":"3C1：能力与表现","author":"Refold","votes":21,"minutes":4,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 外语习得"},{"id":"660585871","title":"2A4：理解等级","author":"Refold","votes":43,"minutes":9,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"667062859","title":"3A2：活动指南","author":"Refold","votes":19,"minutes":4,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"668072036","title":"3B1：语言激活","author":"Refold","votes":41,"minutes":6,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"2077810016032122524","title":"学习如何输出","author":"Morg","votes":71,"minutes":19,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「二语习得」· Morg"},{"id":"2003874115736581429","title":"说日语","author":"Shoui","votes":59,"minutes":4,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「二语习得」· Shoui"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"3599966493","title":"英语明明是世界上最简单的语言之一，为什么中国学生花费了那么长时间还学不好？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":699,"minutes":8,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 699 赞同","evidence":"正文以明确的知乎引用锚点“3B4：活动指南”指向该目标，标题/关键词可唯一定位。"},{"id":"3513356283","title":"有哪些有效的语言学习方法？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":101,"minutes":3,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 101 赞同","evidence":"目录链接卡以明确标题锚点“Thoughts Memo：3B4：活动指南”指向该目标，符合可唯一定位的标题提及。"},{"id":"3334605503","title":"如何学好英语？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":63,"minutes":2,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 63 赞同","evidence":"正文以明确标题链接“3B4：活动指南”指向目标译文；未见正文对该目标内容的独立化用或摘录。"}]}